d <a href=\"/page/Skill_check\" title=\"Skill check\">skill checks</a>.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Intimidate\" title=\"Intimidate\">Intimidate +20</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Intimidate\" title=\"Intimidate\">Intimidate +20</a>:</b> Passive: +20 <a href=\"/page/Competence_bonus\" title=\"Competence bonus\">Competence bonus</a> to the <a href=\"/page/Intimidate\" title=\"Intimidate\">Intimidate</a> skill.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Skill\" title=\"Skill\">Exceptional Alluring Skills Bonus</a> +10<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Skill\" title=\"Skill\">Exceptional Alluring Skills Bonus</a>:</b> +10 Exceptional bonus to <a href=\"/page/Bluff\" title=\"Bluff\">Bluff</a>, <a href=\"/page/Diplomacy\" title=\"Diplomacy\">Diplomacy</a>, <a href=\"/page/Haggle\" title=\"Haggle\">Haggle</a>, <a href=\"/page/Intimidate\" title=\"Intimidate\">Intimidate</a>, and <a href=\"/page/Perform\" title=\"Perform\">Perform</a>.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Incite\" title=\"Incite\">  Incite +126</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thu